### Demo sequence (AC-E03.4). Requires `docker compose up` with the dev profile.
### Run the requests top to bottom. Change @date to a future weekday (Mon-Sat) if needed.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@dealership = 10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@evCheck = 40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@customerAn = 50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@vehicleAn = 60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@customerBinh = 50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@vehicleBinh = 60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@date = 2030-01-15
@startTime = {{date}}T09:00:00

### 1. List service types -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/service-types

### 2. Availability -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/dealerships/{{dealership}}/availability?serviceTypeId={{evCheck}}&date={{date}}

### 3. Book -> 201
# @name book
POST {{host}}/api/v1/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-booking-1

{
  "customerId": "{{customerAn}}",
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleAn}}",
  "dealershipId": "{{dealership}}",
  "serviceTypeId": "{{evCheck}}",
  "startTime": "{{startTime}}"
}

### 4. Replay with the same key -> 200
POST {{host}}/api/v1/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-booking-1

{
  "customerId": "{{customerAn}}",
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleAn}}",
  "dealershipId": "{{dealership}}",
  "serviceTypeId": "{{evCheck}}",
  "startTime": "{{startTime}}"
}

### 5. Conflicting booking, different customer, same slot -> 409
POST {{host}}/api/v1/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-booking-2

{
  "customerId": "{{customerBinh}}",
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleBinh}}",
  "dealershipId": "{{dealership}}",
  "serviceTypeId": "{{evCheck}}",
  "startTime": "{{startTime}}"
}

### 6. Cancel the first booking -> 200
POST {{host}}/api/v1/appointments/{{book.response.body.id}}/cancel

### 7. Rebook the freed slot -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/v1/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-booking-3

{
  "customerId": "{{customerBinh}}",
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleBinh}}",
  "dealershipId": "{{dealership}}",
  "serviceTypeId": "{{evCheck}}",
  "startTime": "{{startTime}}"
}
